# Link-checker exclusions for lychee (.github/workflows/audit-web.yml, weekly B5
# job). Keep each pattern host/path-specific and backed by a verified false
# positive (D4 fix-or-retire review); never exclude a host preemptively.

# Exact bot-specific false positive verified 2026-08-22. LinkedIn returns its
# non-standard anti-automation 999 to Lychee while the profile resolves in a
# browser. Keep the pattern path-specific; GitHub and HTTP error classes stay checked.
^https://www\.linkedin\.com/in/lifegames/?$

# Atlas decision 0158. /developers links the MCP endpoint, which answers JSON-RPC over
# POST only; a GET is 405 by the MCP Streamable HTTP transport, not a dead link. Its
# liveness is measured by the MCP probe in audits/checks/b2-check-wellknown.mjs.
^https://jonathanlloyd\.me/mcp$
